# Google Services (e.g. APIs or Firebase)
#
# Broadened from the bare `google-services.json` because suffixed copies are the common way this file
# ends up committed by accident: a downloaded "google-services-2.json" or a per-environment
# "google-services-staging.json" silently bypasses the exact-name rule. The leading slash anchors to the
# repo root, matching the Gradle plugin's fixed lookup path (app/google-services.json) so a stray
# copy elsewhere in the tree is still flagged rather than ignored by accident.
google-services.json
/google-services.json
google-services-*.json
app/google-services*.json
**/google-services*.json

# Android Profiling
*.hprof

# Signed release APKs staged by tools/sign-release.sh. *.apk above already covers them, but the
# directory is listed so `git status` stays quiet after a release build and nobody is tempted to
# force-add a signed binary to a commit.
dist/
